# Roles, Authority & Governance

## User categories (§4)

**Internal:** CMD, CEO, GM, Dept Heads, Ops/Branch Managers, Field Officers, HR, Accounts, Payroll, Legal, Compliance, DPO, CISO, IT, Supervisors, Guards, CCTV/Control Room, Procurement, Storekeepers, Call Centre, Internal Auditors, System Admins.

**External:** Customers, customer employees, guests/visitors, suppliers/vendors/contractors, applicants, other security companies, consultants, approved vehicle owners/drivers.

## Governance principles (§35A.2) — non-negotiable

1. One business owner per process  
2. Every transaction has a **creator**  
3. Independently **reviewed**  
4. Approved by authorized officer  
5. Remains **auditable**  
6. **Creator ≠ approver** (unless explicit company policy exception)  
7. Share only by RBAC/ABAC  
8. Every decision traceable to an identified officer  

Use shared `libs/approvals` — do not hand-roll per-module approval engines.

## Viewing hierarchy (least privilege)

| User | Scope |
|---|---|
| Guard | Own records only |
| Supervisor | Own + assigned sites |
| Field Officer | Assigned sites + assigned branch |
| Branch Ops Manager | Full branch |
| Branch Manager | Branch + limited company |
| Dept Head | Department-wide + limited company |
| GM / CEO / CMD | Company-wide |
| Customer / Supplier / Applicant | Own org / own transactions / own application only |

## Authorization matrix (summary)

| Activity | Create → … → Final |
|---|---|
| Recruitment | Applicant → HR → HR Mgr → GM → **CEO** |
| Employment | HR → HR Mgr → Dept Head → GM → **CEO** |
| Leave | Employee → Supervisor → HR → Dept Head → GM (if required) |
| Payroll | Payroll → HR Mgr → Finance Mgr → GM → **CEO** |
| Customer contract | Marketing → Legal → GM → CEO → **CMD** (strategic) |
| Procurement | Dept → Procurement → Proc Mgr → Finance Mgr → **GM** |
| Payment voucher | Accountant → Finance Mgr → Auditor? → GM → **CEO** (over threshold) |
| Petty cash | Employee → Supervisor → Finance → Finance Mgr → GM (over threshold) |
| Incident closure | Guard/Supervisor → Field → BOM → GM → **CEO** (major) |
| Policy change | Dept Head → Compliance → GM → CEO → **CMD** |
| System config | SysAdmin → ICT Mgr → CISO → CEO → **CMD** (critical) |

## Standard lifecycle (§35C)

Request → Registration → Verification → Review → Approval → Execution → Monitoring → Reporting → Audit → Management Decision  

Record officer, datetime, action, status at every stage.
